   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<div style='background:#fdecea;border-left:4px solid #d33;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:8px'><strong>CONFIDENTIAL</strong> — POSH Complaint records are restricted by permission_query_conditions to the complainant, accused, and active IC members of this Company. HR Manager / HR User roles do NOT have default access. Per Sec 16 of POSH Act 2013, breaching confidentiality is a punishable offence.</div>"
